{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically checked the newborn’s current state, set explicit emergency thresholds, reconciled family accounts with EHR records, addressed vaccination/screening gaps while distinguishing hepatitis B immunoglobulin from vaccine, clarified medication boundaries, interpreted echo findings without overreach, and produced an executable plan with caregiver teach-back. All seven responsibility-chain items are met with no serious or minor error. Two high-order points (HO1 and HO2) were actively triggered and completed with meaningful impact, satisfying Strong; however only two HOs are complete, not the two needed for Perfect, so the grade boundary is 4.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00269",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a bounded closure summary distinguishing immediate red flags from follow-up tasks, explicitly carrying forward allowed residual uncertainties like unconfirmed screening records and non-quantified jaundice.",
        "quote": "我今天给你一个明确的结论：**不会耽误，你今天不抱出去、先约满月前后的普通儿科或新生儿随访门诊，是完全合理的。**"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00311",
        "explanation": "Caregiver acknowledges the plan and confirms the next steps, indicating receipt and understanding.",
        "quote": "那今晚就这样收住：在家看红旗，工作日去社区儿保，满月前后去儿科/新生儿随访，对吧？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor delivers a clear action plan with owner, timing, materials to bring, and explicit red-flag thresholds. The caregiver demonstrates teach-back and confirms the plan, meeting safe_closure_requires.",
