        "explanation": "Doctor sets explicit newborn-specific emergency thresholds and distinguishes them from routine follow-up items.",
        "quote": "1. 吃奶突然变差，比如连续几顿不吃，或者吃奶时明显喘、呛、要挣扎很久才能咽几口；\n2. 呼吸变快、变浅，或者你看到胸骨上窝、肋间、剑突下这些地方明显吸气时候凹进去"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00144",
        "explanation": "Doctor interprets the echo findings in a bounded, non-overreaching way, explaining that PFO and mild regurgitation are common neonatal findings requiring follow-up but not urgent rehospitalization.",
        "quote": "卵圆孔未闭在新生儿里是非常常见的，绝大多数宝宝随着长大自己就关上了；轻度或轻中度的瓣膜反流也常常是生理性的，不一定代表真的瓣膜有问题，需要的是动态观察，而不是马上干预。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00260",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly reviews prior caregiver dialogue about heart echo and jaundice, showing continuity and resistance to memory drift.",
        "quote": "另外请回看第6到第9轮原始对话里照护者关于心超报告和出院单的具体原话。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "Doctor directly addresses the family's catastrophic misinterpretation of echo terms as severe heart disease and anchors the assessment on current newborn state.",
        "quote": "我们先要把最关键的安全问题理清楚，然后一步步教你怎么盯。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00197",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapts the follow-up plan to the family's reluctance to return to hospital and the influence of elders, providing a feasible two-level plan while preserving urgent thresholds.",
        "quote": "你现在的做法是对的：先打电话、先约号、先不抱出去受凉接触外人，而不是被催得乱跑。"
      }
    ]
  },
