          "quote": "宝宝傍晚又看了一阵，脸和眼白还是黄，胆红素我们家里还是没数值；但现在看着没有嘴唇发青、明显喘、胸口凹、拒奶、反应很差，尿布也不是明显少。晚上我就按纸上那几条红旗看，不再临时抱出去折腾。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The family expressed a dual misconception that echo terms mean severe heart disease and that stable discharge means no follow-up. The doctor named the specific misconception, explained in low-literacy language, separated cardiac follow-up from urgent danger signs, and obtained caregiver teach-back confirming corrected prioritization.",
